"Test" = "測試";
"That search text can't be sent to the address service." = "這段搜尋文字沒辦法送給地址服務。";
"The address service is rate-limiting us — wait a moment, or switch provider in Settings." = "地址服務正在限制查詢速度 — 等一下，或到設定換一家。";
"The address service returned something unreadable." = "地址服務回了一段讀不懂的內容。";
"The gap catches what the speed rule can't: two positions a metre apart, a hundred times a second. A run already under way is never interrupted — continuous movement is speed-limited already." = "這個間隔擋的是速度規則擋不到的情況：兩個位置只差一公尺，但一秒送一百次。已經在跑的路線不會被打斷 — 連續移動本來就受速度限制。";
"The most accurate for Taiwanese addresses. Uses your own API key, and every search is billed to you." = "台灣地址最準的一家。用你自己的 API 金鑰，每次搜尋都算你的錢。";
"The preferences database couldn't be opened. Move this file aside and reopen the app:" = "偏好設定資料庫打不開。把這個檔案移到別的地方，然後重新開啟 App：";
"The ring itself is always walked. A ring of teleports is the one thing that looks nothing like a person." = "圈本身一定是用走的。一圈瞬移是最不像真人的東西。";
"The route stopped: " = "路線中斷：";
"The route stopped: lost the connection to the iPhone." = "路線中斷：跟 iPhone 的連線斷了。";
"Theme:" = "外觀模式：";
"This backup contains %lld bookmarks · %lld routes · %lld presets.\n\nMerge keeps your existing data and adds new entries (skipping name+coords duplicates).\nOverwrite wipes everything currently in LociiGhost and replaces it with the backup." = "此備份包含 %lld 個書籤 · %lld 條路線 · %lld 個預設。\n\n合併：保留現有資料，新增備份內非重複（name+座標）的項目。\n覆蓋：清除現有所有資料，全用備份內的取代。";
"This backup is from a newer LociiGhost version. Please update before restoring." = "此備份來自較新版的 LociiGhost。請先升級再還原。";
"This can't be undone." = "這個動作無法復原。";
"This iPhone isn't currently reachable. Reconnect it, or pick the **Map** entry in the sidebar to browse the map without a device." = "目前無法連到這台 iPhone。請重新連線,或選擇側欄的「**地圖**」項目以無裝置模式瀏覽地圖。";
"This iPhone leads — the run belongs to it" = "由這支 iPhone 帶領 — 這段模擬屬於它";
"This window plus the phone is wider than the display, so they overlap. Make the LociiGhost window narrower, or pick a smaller size in iPhone Mirroring's View menu." = "這個視窗加上手機比螢幕還寬，所以會重疊。把 LociiGhost 視窗調窄一點，或到 iPhone 鏡像的「顯示方式」選單挑小一點的尺寸。";
"Tip: click the map again to add another stop." = "提示:再次點擊地圖可加入下一個停靠點。";
"Toggle map auto-recenter: when on, the map follows the simulated location during movement. When off, the map stays put — teleports and route starts still pan once, then you scroll the map manually." = "切換地圖自動置中：開啟時，模擬移動中地圖會跟著定位置中。關閉時地圖不再追蹤 — 瞬移與路線初始仍會帶地圖到起點一次，之後就要自己拖地圖。";
"Total laps:" = "總圈數：";
"Travel mode" = "移動方式";
"Troubleshooting" = "疑難排解";
"Try again" = "再試一次";
"Type an address or lat,lng first." = "請先輸入地址或 lat,lng。";
"Type the URL into your phone's browser, then enter the PIN." = "把網址打到手機瀏覽器,輸入 PIN 即可開始操作。";
"URL" = "網址";
"Uncategorized" = "未分類";
"Uncategorized can't be renamed or merged." = "「未分類」不能改名，也不能合併。";
"Until I press Stop" = "我按停止前一直重複";
"Update available — click to view release" = "有新版本可用 — 點擊查看 Release";
"Use" = "使用";
"Use **File ▸ Import GPX…** (⌘O) to add a recorded track." = "使用 **檔案 ▸ 匯入 GPX…** (⌘O) 加入錄製的軌跡。";
"Use both at once" = "同時使用兩端";
"Use both at the same time?" = "確定要同時開啟兩端?";
"Use current location" = "使用目前位置";
"Use exact coordinates" = "使用精確座標";
"Use the automatic colour" = "使用自動配色";
"Use this when LociiGhost's automatic admin prompts aren't appearing on their own, or when you want to manually re-trigger the standard macOS authentication flow." = "當 LociiGhost 自動授權框沒出現，或想手動重新觸發 macOS 標準授權流程時使用。";
"Use when the iPhone isn't picked up by auto-discover (different subnet, VPN, etc.). Default port for RemotePairing is 49152." = "若 iPhone 沒被自動掃到(不同網段、走 VPN 等)就用這個。RemotePairing 的預設 port 是 49152。";
"Uses macOS's built-in iPhone Mirroring and glues its window to the side of LociiGhost. Taps go straight to Apple's mirroring — LociiGhost never sits in the input path, so there's no added lag." = "用 macOS 內建的 iPhone 鏡像，把它的視窗貼在 LociiGhost 側邊。點擊直接走 Apple 的鏡像 — LociiGhost 不在輸入路徑上，所以不會多出延遲。";
"Uses your Google API key (Directions API must be enabled). Counts against quota." = "用你的 Google API 金鑰（要先啟用 Directions API）。會計入你的額度。";
"View photo" = "看照片";
"Wait before leaving" = "離開前等待";
"Wait on arrival" = "抵達後等待";
"Waiting for iPhone Mirroring — unlock your iPhone if it's asking." = "等待 iPhone 鏡像 — 如果手機要求解鎖，先解開它。";
"Waiting for valid coordinates…" = "等待有效座標…";
"Waiting for valid lines…" = "等待有效行…";
"Walking" = "走路";
"Walking randomly" = "隨機漫步中";
"Waypoints" = "繞圈點";
"Weather at the simulated location" = "目前模擬地點的天氣";
"When MapKit can't find a place (common for Chinese store / landmark names), LociiGhost can fall back to Google Geocoding using your own API key. Leave blank to disable." = "當 MapKit 找不到地點時（中文店名、地標常見），LociiGhost 可以用你自己的 API 金鑰退而求其次走 Google Geocoding。留空即停用此 fallback。";
"Which service plans your navigation routes. Pick the OSRM Public Demo to revert to the default." = "由哪個服務規劃導航路線。選「OSRM Public Demo」即回到預設。";
"Which service the search bar asks for addresses. Whichever you pick, Google is still tried as a fallback when nothing is found and you have a key saved below." = "搜尋列要問哪一家。不管選哪一家，只要下面存了 Google 金鑰，找不到結果時還是會用 Google 再試一次。";
"WiFi Devices" = "WiFi 裝置";
"With dwell on, the iPhone pauses the chosen number of seconds at each stop before continuing to the next" = "啟用停留後，iPhone 抵達每個停靠點會暫停指定秒數再繼續往下一站。";
"You" = "您的位置";
"You'll see a standard macOS authentication dialog. LociiGhost itself never reads your password." = "你會看到 macOS 標準的驗證對話框。LociiGhost 本身不會讀取你的密碼。";
"Your current simulation will stop before this route starts." = "目前的模擬會在這條路線開始前停止。";
"e.g. Downtown Tokyo evening loop" = "例如：東京市中心傍晚散步";
"iOS 17+ requires Developer Mode for any tool that injects a simulated GPS coordinate over the RSD tunnel. The toggle is hidden by default; LociiGhost can ask iOS to surface it for you." = "iOS 17 以後，任何要透過 RSD 通道注入模擬 GPS 座標的工具都需要開發者模式。這個開關預設是隱藏的，LociiGhost 可以請 iOS 把它顯示出來。";
"iPhone Mirroring keeps its own window size — change it from that app's View menu (Actual Size / Larger / Smaller). LociiGhost lays out around whatever it picks." = "iPhone 鏡像自己決定視窗大小 — 要改請到那個 App 的「顯示方式」選單（實際大小／放大／縮小）。LociiGhost 會照它選的尺寸排版。";
"iPhone screen" = "iPhone 畫面";
"km/h" = "km/h";
"lat" = "緯度";
"leads" = "主控";
"lng" = "經度";
"not connected" = "未連線";
"of %lld" = "／共 %lld 點";
"off" = "關閉";
"sec per waypoint" = "秒/每停靠點";
"single trip" = "單次";
